so that for example they reach orgasm by successful accomplishing
their master's bidding. I'm interested in how to redesign my own 
emotions and sexuality so that they are more compatible with my 
extropian goals than with demands of my genes, which have
already been obsoleted by technology (eg birth control has
subverted the gene-replicating function of sex).  Thus, I'd like to 
redesign my own sexuality, to stimulate my own brain centers in different 
